{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/Creatures_Highlights.gif?t=1749571990\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Mare Show</strong> is a <strong>Horror/Arcade</strong> game set in a macabre circus world, full of mystery, danger...and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Tom Lorich</strong>, a bankrupt compulsive gambler who entered this bizarre world for no apparent reason, and now has to get out at any cost, while experiencing his greatest traumas in the form of strange creatures, created by an enigmatic entity called <strong>Mare</strong>, with unknown motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/gameply_banner.png?t=1749571990\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIFFERENT <strong>CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With different mechanics and visuals, you have to overcome them as best you can. From a pursuer Scarecrow to a macabre shadow, always watching you. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/enemy_showcase.png?t=1749571990\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE <strong>HALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is your safe place. Here you can relax, analyze narrative pieces, change the visual of your flashlight and, of course, enter the dangerous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/Hall_Highlights.gif?t=1749571990\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RELICS</strong> TO FIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect special relics throughout the levels to unlock new flashlight skins and narrative pieces to uncover the story behind this bizarre world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/flashlights_narrative_showcase.gif?t=1749571990\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604520?t=1749571990","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/d599c9815a99ac22fbc448560d5aec881e6e49fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749571990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/422dd41e9de97b00dcada8cef802e77c17f57edc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749571990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/422dd41e9de97b00dcada8cef802e77c17f57edc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749571990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3611470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/Creatures_Highlights.gif?t=1749571990\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Mare Show</strong> is a <strong>Horror/Arcade</strong> game set in a macabre circus world, full of mystery, danger...and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Tom Lorich</strong>, a bankrupt compulsive gambler who entered this bizarre world for no apparent reason, and now has to get out at any cost, while experiencing his greatest traumas in the form of strange creatures, created by an enigmatic entity called <strong>Mare</strong>, with unknown motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/gameply_banner.png?t=1749571990\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIFFERENT <strong>CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With different mechanics and visuals, you have to overcome them as best you can. From a pursuer Scarecrow to a macabre shadow, always watching you. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/enemy_showcase.png?t=1749571990\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE <strong>HALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is your safe place. Here you can relax, analyze narrative pieces, change the visual of your flashlight and, of course, enter the dangerous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/Hall_Highlights.gif?t=1749571990\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RELICS</strong> TO FIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect special relics throughout the levels to unlock new flashlight skins and narrative pieces to uncover the story behind this bizarre world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/flashlights_narrative_showcase.gif?t=1749571990\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["OutZoom"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/598c1fbbfd8115ab6a9cc970102796d87a2f53de/header.jpg?t=1749571990","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117790,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117790/movie480.mp4